      "title": "知识用途筛选、去重与历史修订",
      "description": "C02 recorded synthetic alert materials copied unchanged into new local identities; no asserted real-world authorization.\nReal local PostgreSQL and Qdrant, real existing local embedding service reached by SSH tunnel, real analysis model reached by existing SSH adapter.\nOriginal KB ingest/index and Case HTTP routes/services/storage; only authentication and model transport are adapted. Local general API connection is explicitly the developer role, unlike production aisoc_app.\nOne Case and one Run; no repeated model sampling. Known M01-A/M01-B remain deferred and model quality NOT_PASSED.\nNo vendor/ClickHouse calls configured; unavailable sources and untriggered branches retain actual meanings.\nHistorical card source is a new explicit synthetic fixture (2026-11-01); its assessment and human statement are test data, not genuine business history, authorization or truth. Current C02 materials remain unchanged.\nOne explicit historical feedback revision before this Run; old card retained and excluded from fresh retrieval. Curated applicability tags on one source-preserving method document. No automatic import.",
